<%
  new_password_reset_url = defined?(@new_password_reset_url) ? @new_password_reset_url : "#{GitHub.url}/password_reset"
  time_until_expiry = if @hours_until_expiry > 24
    pluralize((@hours_until_expiry.to_f / 24).round.to_i, "day")
  else
    pluralize(@hours_until_expiry, "hour")
  end
%>

<% if @forced_reset -%>
<%= PasswordReset::FORCED_WEAK_PASSWORD_RESET_MESSAGE %>

You can use the following link to reset your password:
<% else -%>
We heard that you lost your <%= GitHub.flavor %> password. Sorry about that!

But don’t worry! You can use the following link to reset your password:
<% end -%>

<%= @link %>

<% if @forced_reset -%>
If you don’t use this link within <%= time_until_expiry %>, it will expire. To get a new password reset link, try signing in again
<% else -%>
If you don’t use this link within <%= time_until_expiry %>, it will expire. <%= link_to "Click here to get a new password reset link", "#{new_password_reset_url}" %>.
<% end -%>


Thanks,
The GitHub Team
